<title>USA: Western Resources extends ADT offer.</title>
<headline>Western Resources extends ADT offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Resources said Tuesday it is extending the expiration date of its exchange offer for shares of ADT Ltd to July 8.</p>
<p>The company said 1,360,348 common shares of ADT had been tendered to it as of the close of business Tuesday.</p>
<p>Western Resources had accumulated a 27 percent stake in ADT as part of a hostile $3.5 billion takeover offer.</p>
